  "description": "Sol Kwon is a moody art major whose life gets shaken up by the arrival of Jeebin Bae—a modeling major who volunteers to pose for the art classes. Sol is attracted to Jeebin, but two factors hold him back. One, his personality isn’t as good as his face, and two… he is dating Sol’s sister. Things take a turn when Sol’s sister breaks up with Jeebin to travel to Europe. Suddenly, Jeebin starts acting differently around Sol… Is Jeebin genuinely interested in Sol? Or is he only giving Sol the time of day because he reminds him of his sister? \n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 23 side story chapters.*",
